 id=\"LeftNavCat12\"><a href=\"/submersible-drainage-pump\" id=\"6872868\">Submersible Drainage Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat13\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump\" id=\"6872872\">Sewage Submersible Pump</a><ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch\" id=\"6872928\">SS Submersible Sewage Pump with Float Switch</a></li>\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/submersible-sewage-pump-with-grinder\" id=\"6872929\">Submersible Sewage Pump with Grinder</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat14\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump\" id=\"6872880\">Self Suction Screw Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat15\"><a href=\"/submersible-solar-pump\" id=\"7719400\">Submersible Solar Pump</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"con_title\">Contact Us</div>\n<div class=\"contact_box\"><p>JD Frontier</p><p>ADD: City Saddar Road, Rawalpindi, Pakistan</p><p>TEL: <a href=\"tel:+92515553023\">051-5553023</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro_right\">\n<div class=\"pror_wrap\">\n<div class=\"pror_detail\">\n<div class=\"fl\"><div class=\"singglepic\"><img alt=\"Jiadi 4 Inch Plastic Submersible Screw Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://img01.v15cdn.com/nopic.webp\"/></div><link href=\"/images/spic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/></div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Jiadi 4 Inch Plastic Submersible Screw Pump</h1>\n<p>The Jiadi 4 Inch Plastic Submersible Screw Pump was made by plastic, brass and stainless steel material. The advantage of this products is that light weight with big energy. Max flow is 2.5m3/h. Max head can catch 80m. It's suitable for many water supply applications.</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"101039835\"/></p><p><strong>4 inch Plastic Impeller Pump</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image003(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231742204498452.jpg\"/></strong></p><p>The Jiadi 4 Inch Plastic Submersible Screw Pump was made by plastic, brass and stainless steel material. The advantage of this products is that light weight with big energy. Max flow is 2.5m3/h. Max head can catch 80m. It's suitable for many water supply applications. </p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter</strong></p><p style='white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"PingFang SC\", 微软雅黑, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;'>Head max:80m</p><p style='white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"PingFang SC\", 微软雅黑, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;'>Max flow rate: 2.5m3/h</p><p style='white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"PingFang SC\", 微软雅黑, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;'>Maximum diameter: 103mm</p><p style='white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"PingFang SC\", 微软雅黑, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;'><span class=\"attr-name J-attr-name\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; box-sizing: content-box; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\" title=\"Type\">Type: S</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit;\">ubmersible pump</span></p><p style='white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"PingFang SC\", 微软雅黑, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;'><span class=\"attr-name J-attr-name\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: content-box; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\" title=\"Impeller\">Drive: </span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit;\">Screw</span></p><p style='white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"PingFang SC\", 微软雅黑, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;'><span class=\"attr-name J-attr-name\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: content-box; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\" title=\"Warranty\">Warranty: </span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit;\">1 Year</span></p><p style='white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, \"PingFang SC\", 微软雅黑, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;'><span class=\"attr-name J-attr-name\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: content-box; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\" title=\"Certificate\">Certificate: </span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit;\">ISO9001:2008/CE</span></p><p style='white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; ma