</p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231743541924451.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231743594328356.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>This EGD pump could be widely applied to many conditions like household drinking water system, farm irrigation and especially the viscous fluid in the pharmacy, paper, chemicals, brewing, food industry and so on.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231744031246290.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p>Shipping Methods: By sea, by air or by express, it’s up to your requirements.</p><p>Port: Shanghai, Ningbo and Lianyugang</p><p>Lead time: About 20-30 days</p><p>Trade terms: L/C, T/T, D/A, D/P and so on</p><p>Packing Material: Carton or Wooden box</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231744061304317.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Company Introduction</strong></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\">Jiadi is one of the leading submersible pump manufacturers from China. </span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\">We always focused on top quality submersible pumps and motors since Chen Xianyuan founded Jiadi in Taizhou, Zhejiang, since 1988. </span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: ArialMT;\">The first pump was a submersible screw pump, and now, millions</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\">of Jiadi pumps are operating silently and transporting precious water for people all over the world,<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"/>and this number is increasing by million persistently every year.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"/>Jiadi has already become the leading submersible pump brand in many</span></p><p style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; white-space: normal; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 10px 0px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\">countries and regions. In the three decades, we have sharpened our skills and we never stop challenging ourselves to create more stable and reliable pumps for more global users.</span></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231744109980447.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Exhibition</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231744142697321.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; box-sizing: content-box; font-weight: 700;\">1. Q:What's your MOQ?</span><br style=\"box-sizing: content-box; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Roboto; white-space: pre-wrap;\"/><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">A:Trial sample order is OK.</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; car